    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## **Streamer Alert Decisions**\r\n\r\nPlan how your video streaming platform decides when special alerts appear for viewers.\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Choose two **True/False questions** (your conditions).\r\n\r\n2. Build a **flowchart** using those questions to make decisions.\r\n\r\n3. Create **four outcomes**. For each outcome, decide what **notification message** and what **background color** the alert bar will use.\r\n\r\n4. Complete the **Test Cases table** to show how each combination of True/False leads to a specific alert.\r\n\r\n5. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n",
    "display_name": "Streamer Alert Decisions",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Design the logic that determines when special on-screen alerts appear for VIPs or subscribers.",
